blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "### Quest Name\nBuild a Telegram bot that summarizes YouTube videos\n\n### Description\n**What I need**\n\nA Telegram bot that takes a YouTube URL, downloads the video, transcribes it with Whisper, and returns a structured summary with timestamps and key takeaways.\n\n**Requirements**\n- Takes a YouTube URL as input\n- Returns a structured summary with timestamps\n- Works for English and Chinese videos\n- Deployed and accessible via Telegram\n\n**Deliverables**\n- Working bot deployed somewhere (Railway, Vercel, etc.)\n- Source code in a GitHub repo with README\n- 2 rounds of revision included\n\n### Reward (USD)\n800\n\n### Contact\nComment here or reach Jojo as intermediary", "closed_by": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/5/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/5/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "pinned_comment": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/3", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/3/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/3/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/3/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/citarreikee/AGuild/issues/3", "id": 4451133338, "node_id": "I_kwDOSbJhVs8AAAABCU7nmg", "number": 3, "title": "[QUEST] Nvidia BEYOND EXPO 澳门展会人形机器人演示招募", "user": {"login": "citarreikee", "id": 49931345, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTMxMzQ1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49931345?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/citarreikee", "html_url": "https://github.com/citarreikee", "followers_url":